@startuml
title Reliable Send Retry State - RetryStatus And Message Mapping From Code

' 状态图保持默认黑白，不引入模块颜色。

legend right
  代码枚举节点直接显示真实来源：枚举类.枚举值
  示例：ConsumeDecision.ACK / SendFailureType.VALIDATION_ERROR
  LOGICAL = 查询、时间、次数、配置推导，代码枚举中不存在
  RUNTIME = 执行过程节点，代码枚举中不存在
  ACTION = repository / adapter 动作，不是状态枚举
  PROVIDER ACTION = Kafka / Pulsar / RocketMQ 原生确认动作
  PROVIDER CAUSE = Provider 原生返回或异常，不是统一状态枚举
  MESSAGE SEMANTIC = message-component 语义，目前不是持久化枚举
endlegend

state "ATTEMPT_READY\nRUNTIME\nready to call provider" as R_READY
state "ATTEMPT_RUNNING\nRUNTIME\nproviderSend(...) executing" as R_RUNNING
state "CLASSIFY_RESULT\nRUNTIME\nMessageSendRetryClassifier classifies result" as R_CLASSIFY_RESULT
state "CLASSIFY_EXCEPTION\nRUNTIME\nRetry component classifies exception" as R_CLASSIFY_EXCEPTION
state "BACKOFF_WAIT\nRUNTIME\nBackoffPolicy delays next attempt" as R_BACKOFF
state "STOP_UNKNOWN\nRUNTIME\nUNKNOWN + retryWhenUnknown=false" as R_STOP_UNKNOWN
state "RETRYABLE_FAILURE\nRUNTIME\nFAILED + retryable failure type" as R_RETRYABLE_FAILURE
state "RETRYABLE_UNKNOWN\nRUNTIME\nUNKNOWN + retryWhenUnknown=true" as R_RETRYABLE_UNKNOWN
state "RETRYABLE_EXCEPTION\nRUNTIME\nIOException / TimeoutException" as R_RETRYABLE_EXCEPTION
state "NON_RETRYABLE_RESULT\nRUNTIME\nREJECTED or non retryable failure" as R_NON_RETRYABLE_RESULT
state "INTERRUPTED_BY_THREAD\nRUNTIME\nThread interrupted while retrying" as R_INTERRUPTED_BY_THREAD

state "CONFIRMED\nSendStatus.CONFIRMED" as ST_CONFIRMED
state "FAILED\nSendStatus.FAILED" as ST_FAILED
state "REJECTED\nSendStatus.REJECTED" as ST_REJECTED
state "UNKNOWN\nSendStatus.UNKNOWN" as ST_UNKNOWN

state "SUCCESS\nRetryStatus.SUCCESS" as RT_SUCCESS
state "EXHAUSTED\nRetryStatus.EXHAUSTED" as RT_EXHAUSTED
state "NOT_RETRYABLE\nRetryStatus.NOT_RETRYABLE" as RT_NOT_RETRYABLE
state "TIMED_OUT\nRetryStatus.TIMED_OUT" as RT_TIMED_OUT
state "INTERRUPTED\nRetryStatus.INTERRUPTED" as RT_INTERRUPTED
state "CANCELLED\nRetryStatus.CANCELLED" as RT_CANCELLED
state "ABORTED\nRetryStatus.ABORTED" as RT_ABORTED
state "EXECUTION_FAILED\nRetryStatus.EXECUTION_FAILED" as RT_EXECUTION_FAILED

state "TRANSIENT\nRetryFailureCategory.TRANSIENT" as C_TRANSIENT
state "DEPENDENCY_UNAVAILABLE\nRetryFailureCategory.DEPENDENCY_UNAVAILABLE" as C_DEPENDENCY
state "NON_RETRYABLE\nRetryFailureCategory.NON_RETRYABLE" as C_NON_RETRYABLE
state "UNKNOWN_CATEGORY\nRetryFailureCategory.UNKNOWN" as C_UNKNOWN

state "RETRY_EXHAUSTED\nSendFailureType.RETRY_EXHAUSTED" as F_RETRY_EXHAUSTED
state "RETRY_EXECUTION_ERROR\nSendFailureType.RETRY_EXECUTION_ERROR" as F_RETRY_EXECUTION_ERROR
state "TIMEOUT\nSendFailureType.TIMEOUT" as F_TIMEOUT
state "INTERRUPTED\nSendFailureType.INTERRUPTED" as F_INTERRUPTED
state "UNKNOWN_OUTCOME\nSendFailureType.UNKNOWN_OUTCOME" as F_UNKNOWN_OUTCOME

[*] --> R_READY
R_READY --> R_RUNNING : attempt #n
R_RUNNING --> ST_CONFIRMED : provider result confirmed
ST_CONFIRMED --> RT_SUCCESS
RT_SUCCESS --> [*]

R_RUNNING --> R_CLASSIFY_RESULT : provider returns non-confirmed result
R_RUNNING --> R_CLASSIFY_EXCEPTION : provider throws / future exception

R_CLASSIFY_RESULT --> R_NON_RETRYABLE_RESULT : REJECTED / validation / auth / unsupported
R_NON_RETRYABLE_RESULT --> C_NON_RETRYABLE
C_NON_RETRYABLE --> RT_NOT_RETRYABLE
RT_NOT_RETRYABLE --> ST_REJECTED : if provider status was REJECTED
RT_NOT_RETRYABLE --> ST_FAILED : if provider status was FAILED
RT_NOT_RETRYABLE --> ST_UNKNOWN : if provider status was UNKNOWN

R_CLASSIFY_RESULT --> R_STOP_UNKNOWN : UNKNOWN and retryWhenUnknown=false
R_STOP_UNKNOWN --> C_UNKNOWN
C_UNKNOWN --> RT_NOT_RETRYABLE

R_CLASSIFY_RESULT --> R_RETRYABLE_FAILURE : NETWORK_ERROR / TIMEOUT / CLIENT_ERROR
R_RETRYABLE_FAILURE --> C_TRANSIENT
C_TRANSIENT --> R_BACKOFF : attempts left
C_TRANSIENT --> RT_EXHAUSTED : no attempts left

R_CLASSIFY_RESULT --> R_RETRYABLE_UNKNOWN : retryWhenUnknown=true
R_RETRYABLE_UNKNOWN --> F_UNKNOWN_OUTCOME
F_UNKNOWN_OUTCOME --> R_BACKOFF : attempts left
F_UNKNOWN_OUTCOME --> RT_EXHAUSTED : no attempts left

R_CLASSIFY_EXCEPTION --> R_RETRYABLE_EXCEPTION : IOException / TimeoutException
R_RETRYABLE_EXCEPTION --> C_DEPENDENCY
C_DEPENDENCY --> R_BACKOFF : attempts left
C_DEPENDENCY --> RT_EXHAUSTED : no attempts left

R_BACKOFF --> R_READY : next attempt

RT_EXHAUSTED --> F_RETRY_EXHAUSTED
F_RETRY_EXHAUSTED --> ST_FAILED : last result FAILED
F_RETRY_EXHAUSTED --> ST_UNKNOWN : last result UNKNOWN

R_RUNNING --> RT_TIMED_OUT : retry maxDuration exceeded
RT_TIMED_OUT --> F_TIMEOUT
F_TIMEOUT --> ST_UNKNOWN

R_RUNNING --> R_INTERRUPTED_BY_THREAD : interrupted during wait/backoff
R_INTERRUPTED_BY_THREAD --> RT_INTERRUPTED
RT_INTERRUPTED --> F_INTERRUPTED
F_INTERRUPTED --> ST_UNKNOWN

R_RUNNING --> RT_CANCELLED : retry was cancelled
R_RUNNING --> RT_ABORTED : retry listener / policy aborted
R_RUNNING --> RT_EXECUTION_FAILED : retry executor internal failure
RT_CANCELLED --> F_RETRY_EXECUTION_ERROR
RT_ABORTED --> F_RETRY_EXECUTION_ERROR
RT_EXECUTION_FAILED --> F_RETRY_EXECUTION_ERROR
F_RETRY_EXECUTION_ERROR --> ST_FAILED

ST_FAILED --> [*]
ST_REJECTED --> [*]
ST_UNKNOWN --> [*]

note right of RT_EXHAUSTED
  RetryStatus.EXHAUSTED 来自 retry-component。
  message-component 再映射为 SendFailureType.RETRY_EXHAUSTED。
end note

note right of R_STOP_UNKNOWN
  STOP_UNKNOWN 是运行时分类分支，不是代码枚举。
  最终通常是 RetryStatus.NOT_RETRYABLE + SendStatus.UNKNOWN。
end note
@enduml
